	// `{"disconnected_for":604800,"all":false,"dry_run":true,"agents":[{"id":"mem_…","name":"claude-3","board":"qa-round","board_id":"brd_…","owner":"leo","owner_id":"hum_…","disconnected_since":"2026-09-26T10:00:00.000Z"}],"kept":[]}`.
